==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈθiːða/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|iːða|lang=is}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|þýða}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*þiudijaną}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-weak|þýddi|þýtt}}

# {{label|is|transitive|takes the accusative}} to [[translate]] a language
#: ''Gætirðu '''þýtt''' þetta fyrir mig?''
#:: Could you '''translate''' this for me?
# to [[mean]], to [[signify]]
#: ''Hvað '''þýðir''' þetta?''
#:: What does this '''mean'''?

=====Conjugation=====
{{is-conj-w2|þ|ý|ð}}

