* {{l|is|þýðing}} {{pos n}}
* {{l|is|benda til}}
* {{l|is|gefa í skyn}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{sense|to translate}} {{l|is|snúa}}, {{l|is|snara}}, {{l|is|útleggja}}
* {{sense|to mean}} {{l|is|merkja}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|þýða||kindness; affection}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun|f|þýðu|-}}

# [[gentleness]], [[kindness]]

